.SH EXTENSIONS
The symbols
.IR \%WACS_S3 ","
.IR \%WACS_S7 ","
.IR \%WACS_LEQUAL ","
.IR \%WACS_GEQUAL ","
.IR \%WACS_PI ","
.IR \%WACS_NEQUAL ","
and
.I \%WACS_STERLING
are not standard.
However,
many publicly available
.I \%term\%info
entries include
.B \%acs_chars
.RB \%( acsc )
capabilities in which their key characters
.RB ( pryz{|} )
are embedded,
and a second-hand list of their character descriptions has come to
light.
The
.I \%ncurses
developers invented WACS-prefixed names for them.
.\" in v5_2_20020209
